<div class=WordSection1>

<p class=ortabalkbold align=center style='margin:0cm;text-align:center'><a
name="_hlk99655499"><b><span style='font-size:14.0pt;color:maroon'>GÜMRÜK GENEL
TEBLİĞİ<o:p></o:p></span></b></a></p>

<p class=ortabalkbold align=center style='margin:0cm;text-align:center'><span
style='mso-bookmark:_hlk99655499'><b><span style='font-size:14.0pt;color:maroon'>(GÜMRÜK
TARİFE CETVELİ İZAHNAMESİ)<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>

<p class=ortabalkbold align=center style='margin:0cm;text-align:center'><span
style='mso-bookmark:_hlk99655499'><b><span style='font-size:14.0pt;color:maroon'>(SERİ
NO: 4)</span></b></span><b><span style='font-size:14.0pt;color:maroon'><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=balk11pt align=right style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;
margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:0cm;text-align:right'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:
normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>Ticaret Bakanlığından: <a
name="_hlk99655471">29.03.2022 tarih ve 31793 Mükerrer </a><a
target='_blank' href="https://www.resmigazete.gov.tr/eskiler/2022/03/20220329M1-1.htm"
target="_blank"><span style='mso-bookmark:_hlk99655471'>sayılı</span><span
style='mso-bookmark:_hlk99655471'></span></a><span style='mso-bookmark:_hlk99655471'>
R.G.</span><o:p></o:p></span></i></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><i><span
style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow;
mso-fareast-language:TR;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'>Tasarruflu yazılar</span></i><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow;mso-fareast-language:TR'><span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>              </span><a
data-tooltip='06.02.2024 93626160 Hücre kültürlerinin tarife tespitinde izahname hükmü yerine dikkate alınacak husus' target='_blank' href="https://www.gumrukkulliyati.com/index.php?id=docs/gumruk_mevzuati/dosyalar/tasarruflu_yazilar/06.02.2024_93626160_hucre_kulturlerinin_tarife_tespitinde_izahname_hukmu_yerine_dikkate_alinacak_husus.htm"><span
style='text-decoration:none;text-underline:none'>1</span></a></span></b><i><span
style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow;
mso-fareast-language:TR;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'><o:p></o:p></span></i></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:
"Times New Roman",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";background:
silver;mso-highlight:silver;mso-fareast-language:TR'><a href="#icindekiler"><span
style='color:blue'>İÇİNDEKİLER</span></a> <i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='color:maroon'>(Fasıl bazında İzahname Metinleri)<o:p></o:p></span></i></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
